1
00:00:00,837 --> 00:00:03,547
(Sheldon:)I've always found that
an inappropriate slur.

2
00:00:03,715 --> 00:00:05,425
Chickens are not at all timid.

3
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:08,762
(Sheldon:)In fact, when I was young,
my neighbor's chicken got loose...

4
00:00:08,928 --> 00:00:11,968
(Sheldon:)...and chased me up the big elm tree
in front of our house.

5
00:00:14,434 --> 00:00:16,894
(Raj:)-Chickens can't climb trees.
-Thank God.

6
00:00:19,397 --> 00:00:22,277
(Howard:)Okay, I believe a chicken made you
his bitch.

7
00:00:23,902 --> 00:00:26,612
(Howard:)The cricket thing, I don't buy. Bet me.

8
00:00:27,447 --> 00:00:28,737
(Sheldon:)Fair enough.

9
00:00:28,907 --> 00:00:31,367
What stakes do you propose?

10
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:34,910
(Howard:)I will put up
my Fantastic Four Number 48...

11
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:36,959
(Howard:)...first appearance of Silver Surfer...

12
00:00:37,123 --> 00:00:41,083
(Howard:)...against your Flash 123,
the classic "Flash of Two Worlds" issue.

13
00:00:42,378 --> 00:00:44,168
(Sheldon:)All right, you have a wager.

14
00:00:44,506 --> 00:00:45,756
(Howard:)Hmm.

15
00:00:45,924 --> 00:00:48,094
(Leonard:)Great.
Now, how are you gonna settle it? Hmm?

16
00:00:48,259 --> 00:01:00,019
(Raj:)There is no way to determine the species
of the cricket without examining it.

